{"id":"gate-of-all-nations","name":"Gate of All Nations","qid":"Q5527015","country":"Iran","locality":"Marvdasht County","lat":"29.936111111","lon":"52.889027777","built":"-500","year":-500,"year_text":"500 BCE","century":"5th century BCE","era":"Ancient world","period":"","date_basis":"Wikidata, official opening","style":"Achaemenid architecture","heritage":"","type":"gate; hall","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gate_of_All_Nations","text":"The Gate of All Nations (Old Persian: 𐎯𐎢𐎺𐎼𐎰𐎡𐎶𐏐𐎻𐎡𐎿𐎭𐏃𐎹𐎢𐎶, romanized: duvarϑim visadahyum), also known as the Gate of Xerxes, is located in the ruins of the ancient city of Persepolis, Iran. The construction of the Stairs of All Nations and the Gate of All Nations was ordered by the Achaemenid king Xerxes I (486–465 BCE), the successor of the founder of Persepolis, Darius I the Great.","text_source":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gate_of_All_Nations","text_license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","real":[],"depictions":[{"id":"civilization-vii--gate-of-all-nations","game":"civilization-vii","name":"Gate of All Nations","verified":false,"text":"","text_source":"","text_license":"","images":[{"id":"gh-p0dcd9089766","w":1400,"h":787,"credit":{"text":"Screenshot from Civilization VII, © 2K.","source":"https://civilization.fandom.com/wiki/File:Gate_of_All_Nations_in-game_(Civ7).png","via":"Fandom (civilization)","note":"Fandom upload by Zechariah0311 on 2025-02-11"}}]}]}